<title>GERMANY: Dresdner to lead Lufthansa privatisation.</title>
<headline>Dresdner to lead Lufthansa privatisation.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG said on Tuesday it would lead-manage the privatisation of the Germany government's remaining stake in airline Lufthansa AG.</p>
<p>&quot;We will play the leading role in this operation,&quot; Dresdner Bank chief executive Juergen Sarrazin told the bank's half-year news conference.  </p>
<p>Sarrazin said he could not say which other banks would be included in the consortium to issue the shares.</p>
<p>&quot;That is being decided in Bonn at the moment,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
